			"fontSize": 36,
			"fontFamily": 6,
			"text": "Entities:\n\nUser - User can create tickets and columns\n\nTicket -  A ticket belongs to one user. And one column.\n\nColumn - A column can have many tickets.\n\n\nUser {\n    user_id: string;\n    user details: {\n            firstName: string;\n            lastName: string;\n            avatar_url: string;\n        }\n}\n\n\nTicket {\n    ticket_id: string;\n    ticket_title: string;\n    ticket_points: number;\n    ticket_idx: number;\n}\n\n\nColumn {\n    column_id: string;\n    column_name: string;\n    column_idx: number;\n    tickets: Ticket[];\n}",
			"rawText": "",
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "Entities:\n\nUser - User can create tickets and columns\n\nTicket -  A ticket belongs to one user. And one column.\n\nColumn - A column can have many tickets.\n\n\nUser {\n    user_id: string;\n    user details: {\n            firstName: string;\n            lastName: string;\n            avatar_url: string;\n        }\n}\n\n\nTicket {\n    ticket_id: string;\n    ticket_title: string;\n    ticket_points: number;\n    ticket_idx: number;\n}\n\n\nColumn {\n    column_id: string;\n    column_name: string;\n    column_idx: number;\n    tickets: Ticket[];\n}",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.35
