			"updated": 1747067476507,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"customData": {
				"legacyTextWrap": true
			},
			"fontSize": 36,
			"fontFamily": 6,
			"text": "One store\nBoard: {};\nColumns: HashMap<column_id, Column>\nTicket: HashMap<ticket_id, Ticket>\nUsers: HashMap<user_id, User>\n\nHistory: A list of events, which allows us to undo\n\nState transitions:\nWe have some actions, and reducer for handling the\nactions and updating the state. Have reducer for each\nentity, this will foster separation of concerns and allow\neasy testing and maintainability.\n\nNormalise board data.\n\nActions will update state and invoke relevant services to\nupdate state on server side. We can use optimistic update.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n",
			"rawText": "",
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "One store\nBoard: {};\nColumns: HashMap<column_id, Column>\nTicket: HashMap<ticket_id, Ticket>\nUsers: HashMap<user_id, User>\n\nHistory: A list of events, which allows us to undo\n\nState transitions:\nWe have some actions, and reducer for handling the\nactions and updating the state. Have reducer for each\nentity, this will foster separation of concerns and allow\neasy testing and maintainability.\n\nNormalise board data.\n\nActions will update state and invoke relevant services to\nupdate state on server side. We can use optimistic update.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n",
			"autoResize": false,
			"lineHeight": 1.35
		},
